# Billing — public price list (internal)
# UC-128: the list prices a visitor sees on /ikaro-trial, behind the BFF's
# GET /v1/public/billing/prices. Tenant-less: the price list is platform-wide data.
#
# Answers { offered: true, countryCode, currency, taxBehavior, prices: [...] } for a country a visitor
# can sign up from (BR until M28), and { offered: false } for any other country, the US included, and
# for a two-letter code the platform does not know. A malformed code is 400.
#
# Prerequisites:
#   1. pnpm infra:up
#   2. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run migration:run   (the seed migration fills the BR and US prices)
#   3. pnpm --filter @ikaro/backend run dev
#
# REST Client environment: select "local" in the VS Code status bar.
# Tenant access (M25-S17): tenant-less internal route, no feature gate.

@baseUrl     = {{backendUrl}}
@internalKey = {{$dotenv INTERNAL_API_KEY}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HAPPY PATH
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Brazil → 200 { offered: true, taxBehavior: "INCLUSIVE", prices: [...] }
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices?country=BR
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### A lowercase code is accepted → same answer
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices?country=br
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT OFFERED (200, never an error)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### The US has seed prices but is not in SIGNUP_SUPPORTED_COUNTRIES until M28 → 200 { offered: false }
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices?country=US
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Two letters the platform does not know → 200 { offered: false }
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices?country=ZZ
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ERRORS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Malformed code → 400 COUNTRY_CODE_FORMAT_INVALID
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices?country=B1
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### Missing country → 400 COUNTRY_CODE_FORMAT_INVALID
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

### No internal key → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/billing/public-prices?country=BR
